@title Summer Reading 2026 Wrap-Up
@subtitle Hollis Public Library, June to August 2026
@author Hollis Public Library
@date 2026-09

Thank you to every child, teen and family who read with us this summer. Here is how the season went.

## Summer at a glance

kpi Books logged | 8,325 | 6.7 per reader | good

kpi Registered | 1,248 | children and teens
kpi Finished | 683 | 54.7% of readers | good
kpi Closing party | 310 | people on 2026-09-12

## Books logged by month

July was the busiest month, with 3,115 books logged.

data months = month,books; Jun,2340; Jul,3115; Aug,2870
chart bar months y=books focus="Jul" title="Books logged by month"

## Readers by age group

Readers aged 8 to 12 made up the largest group, with 561 registered.

data ages = age group,readers; Under 8,402; 8 to 12,561; 13 to 17,285
chart hbar ages y=readers labels title="Registered readers by age group"

See you next summer!
